SOUND: wasm launcher runs DSInit before Init_Main under DD2_SOUND (parity with native)

Same boot-order fix as tools/native_main.c (see patch 700 rationale): the original
ddmain runs Play_Intro (-> FUN_004159f8 DSInit) before Init_Main; without it the
VAG bank loader skips creating the DS master buffers (0x74f020) and Play_Sound in
Init_Game derefs a null buffer (the wasm OOB at Play_Sound<-FUN_00447aa0<-Init_Game).

--- a/dd2_runtime.c
+++ b/dd2_runtime.c
@@ -85,10 +85,14 @@
        Profile_Init, Sound_Init, VSync+VSyncCallback, InitCardSystem (SaveGames -> card buffer),
        Read_Directory("DIRINFO"), Read_CD_Toc_, Load_Game_Vags -- the VAG load fills the audio
        staging 0x7fa164-0x816ff0 byte-identical to the reference. */
+    /* DD2_SOUND=1: original boot order is ddmain: Play_Intro (-> FUN_004159f8 = DSInit) BEFORE
+       Init_Main -- Load_Game_Vags' bank loader FUN_00416688 only creates the DS master buffers
+       (table 0x74f020) when 0x462d68 is already 1, and Play_Sound derefs them unchecked. */
+    if(getenv("DD2_SOUND")){ extern void FUN_004159f8(int); *(int*)0x462d68 = 0; FUN_004159f8(1); }
     { extern void Init_Main(void); Init_Main(); }
-    /* DD2_SOUND=1: run the real DirectSoundCreate against the COM shim in dd2h_stubs.c
-       (FUN_004159f8 sets 0x462d68=1 itself on success). Default: skip = proven no-sound path. */
-    *(int*)0x462d68 = getenv("DD2_SOUND") ? 0 : 1;
+    /* default: skip DirectSound COM in later init; with DD2_SOUND the flag already holds the
+       live init state (1) so Init_Application-side DSInit calls skip themselves. */
+    if(!getenv("DD2_SOUND")) *(int*)0x462d68 = 1;
     Init_Application((void*)1);
     /* front-end normally sets the video mode (creates the DDraw primary surface) before the race;
        the cold Play_Game bypass skips it -> Set_Draw_Mode(0) here so SetPalette's surface exists.
